module.exports = {"type":"REST","title":"標記價格K線數據","en":"Mark Price Kline/Candlestick Data","api":{"uri":"/openApi/swap/v1/market/markPriceKlines","method":"GET","requiresAuth":false,"rate-limitation":"","ip-rate-limitation":"1","payload":{"symbol":"BTC-USDT","interval":"1h","limit":5},"responseBody":{"code":0,"msg":"","data":[{"open":"42000.0","close":"42100.0","high":"42200.0","low":"41900.0","volume":"100.00","openTime":1704067200000,"closeTime":1704070799999}]},"request":{"info":["按 startTime ≤ openTime ≤ endTime 篩選，響應按 openTime 從新到舊排序並去重。","僅傳 startTime：從起點選取最早的最多 limit 根，仍以倒序返回；僅傳 endTime：返回截至該時間的最近最多 limit 根；兩者均傳：返回範圍內最近最多 limit 根；均不傳：返回截至請求時刻的最近最多 limit 根。","無符合條件的數據時可返回空陣列或不足 limit 根。換週期時新 K 線尚未發布，可返回符合邊界的上一根已可用 K 線。"],"info_en":["Filter by startTime <= openTime <= endTime; return unique candles in descending openTime order.","startTime only: select up to limit earliest candles from the start, then return them descending. endTime only: select up to limit latest candles through that time. Both bounds: select the latest candles within the range. Neither: select the latest candles through request time.","The response may be empty or contain fewer than limit candles when matching data is unavailable. At a period boundary, the previous available candle may be returned if the new candle has not been published and the previous candle satisfies the bounds."],"list":[{"name":"symbol","type":"string","required_zh":"是","required_en":"Yes","values":"","zh":"交易對, 例如: BTC-USDT, 請使用大寫字母","en":"There must be a hyphen/ \"-\" in the trading pair symbol. eg: BTC-USDT"},{"name":"interval","type":"string","required_zh":"是","required_en":"Yes","values":"1m,3m,5m,15m,30m,1h,2h,4h,6h,8h,12h,1d,3d,1w,1M","zh":"K 線週期；1M 為自然月","en":"Candle interval; 1M is a calendar month"},{"name":"timeZone","type":"string","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"0,8","zh":"K 線分桶時區：0 為 UTC+0，8 為 UTC+8，默認 0；時間戳仍為 Unix 毫秒","en":"Candle bucket time zone: 0 for UTC+0, 8 for UTC+8; default 0. Timestamps remain Unix milliseconds"},{"name":"startTime","type":"int64","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"按 openTime 篩選的開始時間，Unix 毫秒時間戳，包含該時間","en":"Inclusive lower bound on openTime as a Unix millisecond timestamp"},{"name":"endTime","type":"int64","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"按 openTime 篩選的結束時間，Unix 毫秒時間戳，包含該時間","en":"Inclusive upper bound on openTime as a Unix millisecond timestamp"},{"name":"limit","type":"int64","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"默認值:500 最大值:1440","en":"default: 500 maximum: 1440"},{"name":"timestamp","type":"int64","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"請求的時間戳，單位為毫秒","en":"Timestamp of initiating the request, Unit: milliseconds"},{"name":"recvWindow","type":"int64","required_zh":"否","required_en":"No","values":"","zh":"請求有效時間空窗值, 單位:毫秒","en":"Request valid time window value, Unit: milliseconds"}]},"response":{"info":["以下為 1h 響應結構示例，並非即時行情或測試結果。","data 為 K 線物件陣列，時間字段為 openTime 和 closeTime，不返回 time。","1M 按 timeZone 對應自然月計算 closeTime。未收盤 K 線的 OHLC/volume 仍可變化，closeTime 不表示已收盤。"],"info_en":["The following is an illustrative 1h response, not live market data or a test result.","data is an array of candle objects. Time fields are openTime and closeTime; this response does not contain time.","For 1M, closeTime uses the next calendar month boundary in timeZone. OHLC/volume may still change for an unfinished candle; closeTime does not indicate that it has closed."],"list":[{"name":"open","type":"string","values":"","zh":"開盤標記價格，以十進位字串返回","en":"Open mark price, returned as a decimal string"},{"name":"close","type":"string","values":"","zh":"收盤標記價格，以十進位字串返回","en":"Close mark price, returned as a decimal string"},{"name":"high","type":"string","values":"","zh":"最高標記價格，以十進位字串返回","en":"High mark price, returned as a decimal string"},{"name":"low","type":"string","values":"","zh":"最低標記價格，以十進位字串返回","en":"Low mark price, returned as a decimal string"},{"name":"volume","type":"string","values":"","zh":"接口返回的 volume 數值，以十進位字串返回","en":"Volume value returned by the endpoint, as a decimal string"},{"name":"openTime","type":"int64","values":"","zh":"K 線週期開始時間，Unix 毫秒時間戳","en":"Candle start time as a Unix timestamp in milliseconds"},{"name":"closeTime","type":"int64","values":"","zh":"K 線週期結束時間，為下一週期起點減 1 毫秒；未收盤 K 線為計畫結束時間","en":"Candle end timestamp in milliseconds: the next period start minus 1 ms; for an unfinished candle, its scheduled end time"}]},"error":{"info":"","info_en":"","list":[]}},"info":{"en":[{"type":"div","info":"Signature Verification: No"},{"type":"div","info":""},{"type":"div","info":"Error Codes: See <a href=\"#/en/Quick%20Start/Error%20Code%20Reference?anchor=cat-futures\" style=\"color:#409eff;\">Error Code Reference — Futures Error Codes</a>"}],"zh":[{"type":"div","info":"是否驗簽: 否"},{"type":"div","info":"接口描述：用於查詢指定交易對的標記價格K線數據。"},{"type":"div","info":"錯誤碼：請參考 <a href=\"#/zh-tw/Quick%20Start/Error%20Code%20Reference?anchor=cat-futures\" style=\"color:#409eff;\">錯誤碼參考 — 合約錯誤碼</a>"}]}}


